WEBVTT

00:05.246 --> 00:09.175
Oh.

00:35.067 --> 00:38.249
Porch light burning through the mountain haze

00:38.449 --> 00:41.470
Autumn wind blowing through the college days

00:42.170 --> 00:46.272
Two amps humming through a plaster wall Chasing

00:46.352 --> 00:50.554
down a dream down a narrow hall Five pairs of

00:50.615 --> 00:54.236
sneakers by the front screen door Tangled up

00:54.336 --> 00:57.538
cables on the living room floor We didn't have a

00:57.578 --> 01:01.840
dime, we didn't have a plan Just a family promise

01:01.880 --> 01:06.143
where the fire began The town goes quiet when the

01:06.243 --> 01:09.847
sun goes down But the basement's shaking in this

01:09.928 --> 01:15.033
mountain town Turn the dials up to ten Take us

01:15.233 --> 01:19.899
back to where we started then Down on Progress

01:19.959 --> 01:22.181
Street where the engines roar

01:26.684 --> 01:30.885
We struck every dream we made Underneath the

01:30.905 --> 01:34.167
streetlights that will never fade From a living

01:34.207 --> 01:38.268
room spark to the stadium heat It all started

01:38.549 --> 01:41.590
beating down on Progress Street

01:47.685 --> 01:50.990
Twin brothers, locking in the rhythm and the

01:51.070 --> 01:55.015
pace, shaking every window in this quiet place.

01:55.035 --> 01:58.019
Younger sister, holding all the notebooks

01:58.120 --> 02:01.885
tight, keeping us together through the longest

02:02.025 --> 02:05.869
night. Maroon and orange on our faded sleeves

02:05.909 --> 02:08.752
Singing out a reckless kind of melody that

02:08.872 --> 02:13.257
believes The years roll by like a highway train

02:13.297 --> 02:17.060
Through the blinding sun and the pouring rain

02:17.080 --> 02:21.805
Turn the dials up to ten Let the whole valley hear

02:21.905 --> 02:26.368
us once again And down on Progress Street, where

02:26.408 --> 02:29.388
the engines roar We were building up the world

02:29.609 --> 02:33.009
behind a locked front door Every call we struck,

02:33.289 --> 02:36.490
every dream we made Underneath the

02:36.530 --> 02:39.711
streetlights that will never fade From a living

02:39.791 --> 02:43.772
room spark to the stadium heat It all started

02:44.092 --> 02:47.133
beating down on Progress Street

02:50.140 --> 02:54.083
20 years of highways, 20 years of miles Through

02:54.103 --> 02:57.206
the broken promises and the crowded aisles When

02:57.226 --> 03:00.809
the static gets loud and the road gets long We

03:00.889 --> 03:04.151
come back home to the very first song

03:36.415 --> 03:40.359
Down on Progress Street Where the engines roar

03:40.439 --> 03:43.322
We were building up a world behind a locked front

03:43.402 --> 03:47.846
door Every chord we struck, every dream we made

03:48.086 --> 03:50.448
Underneath the streetlights that will never

03:50.568 --> 03:54.692
fade From a living room spark to the stadium heat

03:54.772 --> 03:59.416
It all started beating down on Progress Street

04:02.090 --> 04:09.234
Where the fire began Five hearts beating

04:16.418 --> 04:19.200
as

04:19.981 --> 04:20.081
one

